Make sure the env var KEY evaluates to the path of the current project (see README in folder "case-studies")

Run
    sh benchmark
The contracts
    - removeOneOnceCAT
    - removeOneTwiceCAT
will be verified with benchmark (warmup of JVM)

The contracts
    - removeOneThriceCAT
    - removeOneQuadCAT

will be verified WITHOUT warmup, since both proofs take enough time that the effects warmup of JVM is insignificant.

IMPORTANT: For removeOneQuadCAT, the warmup is not recommended: the proof is expected to last more than 90 minutes,
and with the warmup would take 11 times longer.
The proof will be loaded interactively, so that it can be left running in the dedicated window (KeY GUI)
and it is possible to pause and resume it.
This is not possible from the terminal.


The first run of KeY4CATs IS EXPECTED to show a warning because the main folder .key4cats does not exists.
